    description: Concept DOI — always resolves to the latest version
repository-code: "https://github.com/chinamyeloma/china-myeloma-clinical-trials"
url: "https://chinamyeloma.org/en/clinical-trials/dataset"
abstract: >-
  Open dataset of multiple myeloma clinical trials registered in mainland China,
  curated by CMDN from official NMPA/CDE public filings with normalised and
  deduplicated study centres, registry status tiers, structured eligibility
  criteria, and an archived PDF of the original filing behind every record.
